WEBVTT

01:30.320 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:54.840 --> 01:56.000
That's about it.

01:57.040 --> 01:59.680
Doesn't it feel better to let it out?

01:59.760 --> 02:02.280
Don't worry. I won't tell anyone.

02:03.320 --> 02:04.160
Thank you.

02:09.240 --> 02:11.920
This is my first day in the sect.

02:12.000 --> 02:13.840
Elder Cang arranged a place for me
in the disciple's quarter.

02:13.920 --> 02:16.240
I will be punished if I get back late.

02:17.440 --> 02:21.240
The leader's funeral is tomorrow.

02:22.280 --> 02:23.480
Rest well.

02:42.360 --> 02:43.480
Mr. Nan,

02:45.440 --> 02:46.480
thank you for taking me here.

02:46.560 --> 02:48.320
I wouldn't have found him otherwise.

02:48.840 --> 02:51.600
Aren't you going to say something to him?

02:53.400 --> 02:54.360
I don't have to.

02:54.880 --> 02:58.320
He kept me accompanied from a distance
at my father's funeral.

02:59.160 --> 03:00.840
We have a tacit.

03:03.240 --> 03:04.640
I forgot.

03:04.720 --> 03:07.320
You know what it feels like
to lose a father.

03:07.920 --> 03:10.120
I heard that your father was murdered
by a Spirit Clan member.

03:10.640 --> 03:12.880
Did you find the murderer and revenge him?

03:26.200 --> 03:29.680
People who deserve to die are dead,

03:31.800 --> 03:32.880
and I got my revenge.

03:34.160 --> 03:35.160
Good.

03:37.440 --> 03:39.120
Let me walk you back
to the disciple's quarter.

03:43.840 --> 03:46.360
How much do you like Xie Xuechen?

03:49.040 --> 03:50.560
Why are you bringing that up
all of a sudden?

03:51.280 --> 03:54.520
I'm just wondering
why you like him so much.

03:55.080 --> 03:58.720
Maybe you knew him longer than he knows.

04:07.280 --> 04:08.640
I think I just got my answer.

04:09.480 --> 04:10.840
I've been thinking

04:10.920 --> 04:14.800
why there's a vibe of old memories
and sorrow when you look at him

04:14.880 --> 04:17.279
instead of just love and admiration.

04:18.800 --> 04:22.440
Your eyes are full of secrets.

04:23.280 --> 04:26.240
Xie Xuechen couldn't see that,
but I see it clearly.

04:33.600 --> 04:35.120
You are so smart

04:36.480 --> 04:37.520
that there's no hiding from you.

04:38.120 --> 04:39.880
But he doesn't remember.

04:40.640 --> 04:41.840
Why not tell him?

04:45.960 --> 04:47.320
I wanted to.

04:48.760 --> 04:52.640
But then, I thought
he had gone through enough hardships.

04:53.720 --> 04:55.240
Our encounter

04:56.280 --> 04:58.880
was not a happy memory for him.

04:59.640 --> 05:00.960
Mister!

05:04.080 --> 05:05.520
He doesn't need to remember.

05:05.600 --> 05:06.560
I'll keep in mind

05:07.960 --> 05:09.160
what I owe him.

05:11.760 --> 05:12.880
Is that so?

05:15.240 --> 05:16.120
What about me?

05:21.400 --> 05:22.920
Do you remember our encounter?

05:28.040 --> 05:31.560
The answer to that question is also clear.

05:36.200 --> 05:38.040
Though you look different,

05:38.600 --> 05:43.440
I can still sense
that familiar scent and expression on you.

05:47.160 --> 05:49.280
I didn't know your name.

05:50.880 --> 05:55.360
I do remember you were wearing
a Spirit Lock on your ankle,

05:57.000 --> 05:59.880
and there were
golden imprints on your face.

06:01.200 --> 06:02.960
I just lost three apertures at the time.

06:03.640 --> 06:06.400
My father brought me to Moonlight Heights
to borrow the Chaos Pearl.

06:08.320 --> 06:11.680
Everyone looked at me with pity.

06:14.560 --> 06:16.560
You were the only one who truly saw me.

06:17.680 --> 06:19.720
You knew that I don't need pitying.

06:20.360 --> 06:21.680
You looked at me
like I'm not different from others.

06:22.280 --> 06:23.840
You promised me,

06:24.640 --> 06:26.000
"I'll give you some candy,

06:26.520 --> 06:30.560
and you will give me a little affection."

06:33.840 --> 06:37.080
I will be your friend. What do you say?

06:38.240 --> 06:41.960
I heard
that affection is a precious thing.

06:42.680 --> 06:45.360
Give me some of your candy,

06:45.440 --> 06:48.480
and I will give you a little affection.

06:50.160 --> 06:51.600
Agreed?

06:53.600 --> 06:54.720
You are

06:57.320 --> 06:58.440
that young man.

07:03.680 --> 07:07.680
-It's my fault. That was just--
-So, you are eating your words.

07:10.920 --> 07:13.560
You are not giving me
the affection you owe me.

07:18.120 --> 07:19.040
I…

07:24.080 --> 07:25.800
I was pulling your leg.

07:31.480 --> 07:34.600
You have left that experience in the past,
and you are the golden boy right now.

07:34.680 --> 07:36.840
There are a lot of people who adore you.

07:36.920 --> 07:39.920
My affection is insignificant.

07:41.480 --> 07:45.080
The excuse Ms. Mu is using
sounds quite comforting.

07:48.480 --> 07:50.160
Then I'll keep owing you that.

07:50.680 --> 07:52.720
I will find a way to pay you back.

07:54.080 --> 07:58.120
But why did you choose
to tell me that right now?

08:00.880 --> 08:02.320
You just said it.

08:02.840 --> 08:05.920
Keeping things to oneself

08:07.320 --> 08:08.600
is bad for health.

08:12.280 --> 08:13.320
Ms. Mu,

08:13.960 --> 08:15.200
I'm curious.

08:16.000 --> 08:17.920
You were in Moonlight Heights.

08:18.560 --> 08:20.160
How did you end up in the Dark Abyss?

08:20.800 --> 08:23.560
-Besides, you and Xuechen--
-Some secrets can be shared,

08:24.160 --> 08:26.000
and some can't.

08:26.840 --> 08:30.320
You are a wise man.
I believe that you can understand.

08:34.039 --> 08:34.960
It's okay.

08:35.960 --> 08:37.200
Let's go, old friend.

08:47.440 --> 08:49.480
Xies on the Snow Cliff

08:50.000 --> 08:54.280
will be the only constant flag
in this unpredictable world.

08:55.000 --> 08:56.920
As long as we don't change,

08:57.440 --> 08:59.880
the mundane world that is following
the lead of the Snow Cliff

09:01.000 --> 09:03.280
will keep functioning.

09:12.360 --> 09:13.680
I gave you Klicks

09:14.520 --> 09:17.920
along with the fate of the world.

09:21.160 --> 09:24.280
Klicks and the jade token
are symbols of trust.

09:25.080 --> 09:29.560
I believe
that you will do better than me.

09:52.120 --> 09:53.040
Father,

09:54.440 --> 09:57.680
I will find my way
and live up to your expectations.

10:15.160 --> 10:18.600
TOMB OF SWORDS

10:47.280 --> 10:49.240
Farewell, Leader.

11:01.400 --> 11:03.720
Farewell, Leader.

11:05.640 --> 11:07.320
Snow City can last for a thousand years,

11:08.680 --> 11:12.440
not because of the strength of a few men,

11:12.520 --> 11:15.360
but the indestructible faith
of all members.

11:16.480 --> 11:18.000
As harsh as the environment

11:19.120 --> 11:20.800
and bumpy as the road,

11:21.320 --> 11:23.120
we can still uphold our faith in our goal

11:26.280 --> 11:28.160
and find the way to the top.

11:28.240 --> 11:29.800
Even death cannot change that.

11:59.480 --> 12:03.200
The leader has passed away.
There will be peace no more.

12:04.680 --> 12:08.360
That's one more reason that we
should use our swords for our faith

12:09.880 --> 12:11.320
and clear the evilness in the world.

12:18.560 --> 12:19.800
The funeral is completed.

12:21.120 --> 12:22.640
We are facing a new beginning.

12:25.640 --> 12:27.000
The road ahead is long.

12:28.640 --> 12:31.520
We shall keep pursuing our path,

12:32.560 --> 12:35.240
our sword craftsmanship, and our faith.

12:35.760 --> 12:37.840
We shall keep in mind
that righteousness brought us together,

12:39.160 --> 12:40.040
and we cannot yield.

12:42.120 --> 12:44.520
Yes, my lord.

12:56.120 --> 12:58.960
JADE SKY PALACE

12:59.040 --> 13:01.960
JADE SKY PALACE

13:17.000 --> 13:20.640
XUANTIAN SECT

13:25.880 --> 13:28.760
SAINT FAJIAN, LORD OF XUANTIAN SECT

13:28.840 --> 13:31.440
SAINT YINIAN, ELDER OF XUANTIAN SECT

13:31.520 --> 13:34.320
XUAN XIN, FIRST DISCIPLE OF XUANTIAN SECT

13:50.800 --> 13:54.720
MIRAGE PALACE, HALL OF LIVELY SPRING

13:54.800 --> 13:56.440
OSPREY ISLAND

13:56.520 --> 13:59.760
HE XIANWO, LORD OF OSPREY ISLAND

14:00.720 --> 14:02.920
DUAN XIAORONG, MISTRESS OF JADE SKY PALACE
FU YUANTING, LORD OF JADE SKY PALACE

14:12.400 --> 14:13.680
Any news from the master?

14:15.920 --> 14:17.840
When is he arranging for us
to leave the city?

14:19.880 --> 14:21.080
The master has responded

14:21.160 --> 14:24.160
that you should stay in the city
and not act recklessly.

14:27.480 --> 14:29.440
Xuechen is a smart kid.

14:30.480 --> 14:31.920
If I stay longer,

14:32.680 --> 14:34.400
I may lose my chance to leave.

14:34.920 --> 14:36.080
Elder Yu.

14:39.720 --> 14:40.880
Elder Yu.

14:45.800 --> 14:47.400
-My lord.
-Sit.

14:48.640 --> 14:49.560
Please.

14:52.040 --> 14:54.800
My lord, what brought you here?

14:55.400 --> 14:56.800
Elder Yu. Do you remember

14:57.320 --> 15:00.240
that we have an unfinished chess game
from ten years ago?

15:02.720 --> 15:06.200
I could hardly remember it
if you didn't bring it up.

15:06.760 --> 15:09.320
I remember you insisted
on having a game with me.

15:09.920 --> 15:11.480
If I remember correctly,

15:11.560 --> 15:13.560
I was winning back then.

15:13.640 --> 15:17.680
The game hasn't finished yet.
How can you tell who's winning?

15:18.400 --> 15:21.920
How about we finish the game today?

15:22.000 --> 15:23.040
What do you say?

15:24.360 --> 15:25.560
All right.

15:32.400 --> 15:35.800
Xuechen, it seems that

15:36.320 --> 15:38.920
you didn't improve
your chess skills in the last ten years.

15:40.360 --> 15:44.960
This game is ten years old now.

15:45.520 --> 15:47.400
Elder Yu, you are still good.

15:47.920 --> 15:49.320
You never cut me any slack.

15:51.760 --> 15:54.120
You care about winning and losing so much.

15:54.200 --> 15:55.600
I guess

15:55.680 --> 15:58.360
you have put a stake in this game.

15:58.440 --> 16:01.160
I do. There is a stake.

16:03.040 --> 16:05.000
Care to elaborate?

16:05.880 --> 16:07.320
If I win,

16:08.560 --> 16:10.280
you'll tell me where the master
of the Decaying Immortal Pavilion is.

16:11.480 --> 16:15.120
If I lose, you can have
the Sect Leader's Jade Token.

16:18.200 --> 16:20.280
He doesn't have
his full power right now. Attack!

16:26.600 --> 16:27.960
Your spiritual power has come back.

16:30.640 --> 16:34.000
I fully recovered
before arriving at Snow City.

16:40.920 --> 16:43.120
Elder Yu, you are the head
of law enforcement in Snow City.

16:43.200 --> 16:44.600
You should know

16:45.400 --> 16:47.240
the punishment for colluding
with the Decaying Immortal Pavilion,

16:47.320 --> 16:48.720
murdering the alliance leader,

16:49.360 --> 16:51.000
and causing chaos in the human realm.

16:53.320 --> 16:54.880
I think you know

16:55.480 --> 16:58.880
that with me here,
you will not step out of the door.

17:04.920 --> 17:06.599
Finish this game with me.

17:07.200 --> 17:10.160
Let's finish what we started.

17:23.359 --> 17:24.920
Why did you betray us?

17:29.280 --> 17:30.760
Do you remember

17:33.200 --> 17:34.920
that the Immortals Array was broken once?

17:35.760 --> 17:39.200
I organized our disciples
to resist the Dark Clan.

17:39.760 --> 17:41.840
Nan Xuyue and you came to help us.

17:41.920 --> 17:43.040
On that day,

17:44.440 --> 17:47.480
there were 210 disciples
who fought under my lead

17:49.520 --> 17:50.920
and none survived.

17:52.600 --> 17:53.560
I…

17:57.560 --> 18:00.080
I will never forget their eyes.

18:01.680 --> 18:03.240
Killing members of the Dark Clan

18:04.280 --> 18:07.160
is easy for you people.

18:07.240 --> 18:09.200
But for us,

18:11.440 --> 18:14.200
they are formidable.

18:15.320 --> 18:17.240
The Decaying Immortal Pavilion
is a powerhouse.

18:17.320 --> 18:19.440
Their master is an unpredictable man.

18:19.520 --> 18:22.360
He found me and asked for my assistance.

18:24.560 --> 18:25.800
I didn't want to die.

18:27.240 --> 18:28.320
So…

18:31.000 --> 18:33.480
So, I had to choose another leader.

18:35.120 --> 18:36.760
Is it just about living?

18:37.360 --> 18:38.280
Just?

18:42.800 --> 18:44.320
Easy for you to say.

18:45.280 --> 18:46.760
That's what makes you different from us.

18:47.360 --> 18:51.480
Death is just a normal
and natural thing for you.

18:51.560 --> 18:54.920
But for us, living…

18:56.520 --> 18:58.240
is our goal.

19:00.320 --> 19:02.400
What does the master
of the Decaying Immortal Pavilion want?

19:03.920 --> 19:07.160
Peace of the world.

19:07.240 --> 19:08.680
Peace of the world.

19:09.280 --> 19:12.400
At the cost
of the alliance leader, you, me,

19:13.000 --> 19:14.320
and everyone else's life.

19:14.400 --> 19:15.520
Is that it?

19:15.600 --> 19:17.600
You don't care
about the peace of the world.

19:18.800 --> 19:20.680
You are just succumbing to your fear.

19:29.000 --> 19:30.800
Who murdered the alliance leader?

19:32.560 --> 19:33.880
I don't know.

19:36.200 --> 19:37.240
That night,

19:39.440 --> 19:41.040
I got a letter
from the Decaying Immortal Pavilion,

19:41.800 --> 19:42.760
asking me to distract
the guarding disciples

19:42.840 --> 19:44.640
at the alliance leader's
seclusion location.

19:45.160 --> 19:46.040
I did their bidding.

19:47.080 --> 19:49.880
YONGQIAN PAVILION

19:49.960 --> 19:50.920
Get the disciples to leave.

19:51.000 --> 19:51.880
Elder Yu.

19:52.400 --> 19:54.240
Leave the Yongqian Pavilion defenseless.

19:54.840 --> 19:58.200
The leader's seclusion is about to end.
Come with me for the preparation.

19:58.280 --> 20:00.920
-You exposed the leader to enemy attack.
-Yes.

20:01.000 --> 20:01.920
Yes.

20:02.000 --> 20:04.600
That's how he was killed
without a struggle.

20:04.680 --> 20:06.080
What else did you do?

20:06.160 --> 20:08.280
I put a sound barrier over the place

20:08.360 --> 20:10.440
to keep the noise down

20:10.520 --> 20:14.040
in case the leader calls for help.

20:15.520 --> 20:17.920
I don't know

20:18.520 --> 20:20.080
what happened after that.

20:31.960 --> 20:33.560
Where is the Master
of the Decaying Immortal Pavilion?

20:34.560 --> 20:37.960
The Master of the Decaying
Immortal Pavilion is a fickle man.

20:39.800 --> 20:41.280
No one knows where he is.

20:42.120 --> 20:45.480
I communicate with him in letters,
not face to face.

20:49.160 --> 20:50.280
Xuechen,

20:53.080 --> 20:57.560
does the result of this game

20:58.360 --> 21:02.480
mean so much to the two of us?

21:03.840 --> 21:05.640
The Spirit Clan, the Dark Clan,

21:05.720 --> 21:07.800
and the Decaying Immortal Pavilion
have formed an alliance.

21:08.400 --> 21:10.320
You might be powerful,

21:11.080 --> 21:15.720
but can you protect the whole world
on your own?

21:39.680 --> 21:41.240
Do you…

21:49.360 --> 21:51.600
Do you have to go to extremes?

21:57.720 --> 21:59.320
The result doesn't matter.

22:02.880 --> 22:05.360
What matters is that
you've made your choice.

22:07.360 --> 22:08.400
I just

22:10.800 --> 22:13.840
want to finish this one last game

22:16.080 --> 22:17.640
with the man who once fought by my side.

22:49.040 --> 22:50.760
Maybe you are right.

22:52.560 --> 22:54.000
I am not good enough

22:56.400 --> 22:58.600
to protect everyone.

23:00.800 --> 23:03.240
If I have sensed your fear earlier,

23:06.080 --> 23:08.600
things wouldn't have come to this.

23:22.520 --> 23:23.440
Xuechen,

23:27.280 --> 23:28.840
enemies in the dark are all taken care of.

23:29.840 --> 23:30.680
Good.

23:31.320 --> 23:34.200
I'll take it from here.

23:35.840 --> 23:38.680
Sang Qi and the Decaying Immortal Pavilion
are not going to stop.

23:39.640 --> 23:42.560
When all the sects arrive,
there will be trouble.

23:44.320 --> 23:47.640
Starting from tonight, the barrier
over Snow City shall be reinforced.

23:47.720 --> 23:50.120
Everyone who enters or leaves
shall be monitored.

23:50.200 --> 23:51.040
Yes.

23:52.280 --> 23:53.240
My lord.

23:55.360 --> 23:56.600
There's one more thing.

23:57.360 --> 23:59.040
The new disciple…

24:07.160 --> 24:09.160
I met her at the Two Realms Mountain.

24:09.960 --> 24:12.120
My road back was full of dangers.

24:12.200 --> 24:13.800
She never left me hanging.

24:13.880 --> 24:15.960
She has the intention for cultivation.

24:16.480 --> 24:18.080
She's just a little naughty.

24:18.600 --> 24:21.600
Elder Cang, please be patient with her.

24:46.320 --> 24:49.840
Xie Xuechen. There is it.

24:52.360 --> 24:56.480
You are the lord of Snow City,
yet you killed a human being.

24:57.960 --> 25:00.040
I never said
that I don't kill human beings.

25:01.080 --> 25:02.440
The law of the world says

25:02.960 --> 25:05.120
that murderers shall be punished
and killers shall pay for their lives.

25:06.040 --> 25:07.160
I don't kill for no good reason,

25:08.640 --> 25:09.960
and I won't let criminals slip
through my fingers.

25:11.200 --> 25:13.360
-What about the Spirit Clan?
-The same.

25:16.360 --> 25:18.480
The Spirit Management Bureau
is not thinking the same.

25:19.600 --> 25:22.000
Guilty human beings
are enjoying a good life

25:22.760 --> 25:25.600
while innocent members
of the Spirit Clan are suffering.

25:25.680 --> 25:27.440
We can't generalize the problem.

25:28.360 --> 25:30.640
-But I will find a way to change things.
-How?

25:32.080 --> 25:33.480
Starting with you
being a decent human being.

25:35.640 --> 25:38.400
I sensed sarcasm.

25:38.480 --> 25:40.440
Respect your identity
as the Snow City disciple.

25:40.960 --> 25:42.400
Let people know

25:42.480 --> 25:44.760
that not all members of the Spirit Clan
are cruel and violent.

25:47.080 --> 25:48.800
You have misunderstood me.

25:48.880 --> 25:51.280
I am the best at being cruel and violent.

25:54.120 --> 25:57.560
I'm only gentle in front of you.

25:58.240 --> 26:01.480
Unless you can promise me rewards.

26:02.560 --> 26:03.600
What kind of rewards?

26:05.360 --> 26:06.880
You tell me.

26:10.760 --> 26:11.840
In your dream!

26:17.120 --> 26:20.040
Starting from tomorrow,
you will show up at the Hall of Heritage.

26:21.080 --> 26:22.640
For every mistake you make,
there will be a record.

26:22.720 --> 26:25.200
Get ten records
and you shall leave Snow City.

26:28.400 --> 26:30.760
You are the only one
who dares to talk to me like that.

26:30.840 --> 26:31.720
If it's someone else,

26:31.800 --> 26:33.560
I'll make sure
that he never sees one more sunrise.

26:35.040 --> 26:38.040
HALL OF HERITAGE

26:40.000 --> 26:42.040
I thought I could spend more time

26:42.120 --> 26:44.320
with Xie Xuechen
after joining the Snow City.

26:44.840 --> 26:48.840
I never expected
to have classes every day.

26:52.800 --> 26:54.160
Mu Xuanling.

26:54.240 --> 26:57.720
Tell the class
why you joined the Snow City.

26:59.720 --> 27:00.560
I…

27:03.240 --> 27:06.040
My father adopted me when I was a child.

27:06.680 --> 27:09.840
He was not in good health or temper.

27:09.920 --> 27:12.920
He looked like a zombie every day.

27:25.360 --> 27:26.800
The place we lived in

27:26.880 --> 27:29.160
was a barren landscape
without a scrap of vegetation.

27:29.240 --> 27:32.080
People fought and killed for a living.

27:32.160 --> 27:35.040
My father wanted me to be loyal to him,

27:35.120 --> 27:36.480
so he threw me into the habit of bandits

27:36.560 --> 27:39.760
and used all kinds of means
to force me to gain strength.

27:40.600 --> 27:43.520
Mr. Xie was the one who saved me.

27:45.520 --> 27:47.080
What happened after that?

27:47.160 --> 27:51.520
So, to pay my debt, I came here.

27:54.120 --> 27:55.480
Okay.

27:55.560 --> 27:57.280
In the five sects
of the Immortal Alliance,

27:57.360 --> 28:00.000
the Xuantian Sect Curse
aims at fighting the Dark Clan.

28:01.400 --> 28:03.520
The spiritual plants
from the Mirage Palace

28:03.600 --> 28:05.320
are the best in the world.

28:05.840 --> 28:08.400
The Jade Sky Palace
focuses on the study of artifacts.

28:08.480 --> 28:11.680
The Osprey Island
worships the power of nature.

28:12.320 --> 28:15.480
Snow City focuses on sword craftsmanship.

28:16.320 --> 28:18.200
You mentioned that you were trained.

28:18.280 --> 28:22.200
Show me your progress and your talent.

28:26.960 --> 28:28.720
I can't let them know
that I'm from the Spirit Clan.

28:28.800 --> 28:30.280
It will be bad
if they kick me out of the city.

28:33.480 --> 28:36.280
I don't even have a sword.
I can't show you.

28:36.960 --> 28:39.240
It's okay. The sword is in your mind.

28:41.680 --> 28:44.920
The way of cultivation
in the Immortal Alliance has three stages.

28:45.600 --> 28:47.000
The first is the golden essence.

28:47.080 --> 28:48.120
The second is the spirit manifestation.

28:48.640 --> 28:50.120
The top is the spiritual form.

28:51.080 --> 28:55.000
The spiritual form stage
is the goal for all cultivators.

28:55.760 --> 28:58.480
Forms represent cultivators,

28:58.560 --> 29:01.040
of their mind and their power.

29:02.280 --> 29:05.480
We are at the place
that is thickest with aura in Snow City.

29:06.200 --> 29:08.000
It will help you
with developing your spiritual form.

29:08.080 --> 29:10.040
The lesson 101 of the sect

29:10.680 --> 29:14.680
is manifesting what's in your mind.

29:15.240 --> 29:16.080
All right.

29:16.160 --> 29:20.440
Exercise hard and build a good foundation.

29:23.200 --> 29:26.360
It's hard to contemplate quietly,
but it doesn't call for talent.

29:26.960 --> 29:31.240
Just put the worldly thoughts aside
and focus your mind on one thing

29:31.320 --> 29:33.320
to summon

29:35.040 --> 29:36.600
a physical object.

29:37.840 --> 29:38.920
Try it.

29:51.960 --> 29:55.480
Isn't my physical object quite powerful?

29:59.960 --> 30:01.000
Really good.

30:04.640 --> 30:05.720
You have to know

30:06.480 --> 30:09.080
that the strength of your spiritual power
does not rely on the spiritual form.

30:09.920 --> 30:12.800
It's about the power of the cultivator.

30:13.360 --> 30:16.840
So, do exercise hard and no slacking off.

30:19.800 --> 30:22.880
I want you to keep your behavior in check.

30:22.960 --> 30:24.440
Don't do anything absurd.

30:24.960 --> 30:27.600
And no disrespect to His Grace.

30:31.080 --> 30:32.200
All right.

30:32.280 --> 30:34.440
Let's call it a day. Class is over.

30:39.000 --> 30:41.080
Elder Xie.

30:47.600 --> 30:48.600
Mu Xuanling.

30:52.160 --> 30:53.680
Yes, Elder.

30:56.440 --> 30:59.240
You just joined us
and I forgot to tell you.

30:59.320 --> 31:00.520
New disciples of the Snow City

31:01.120 --> 31:02.400
can have days off on Qingming Festival,
Mid-Autumn Festival,

31:02.480 --> 31:03.760
and the eve of the Spring Festival.

31:03.840 --> 31:07.040
Other than those, they shall wake up
at the Mao hour and train till noon.

31:07.120 --> 31:10.480
In the afternoon, they will do chores,
farming, or guarding,

31:10.560 --> 31:12.720
as they were assigned.

31:12.800 --> 31:15.240
It's your turn to clean up today.

31:17.360 --> 31:19.040
Can I use my power to do that?

31:19.120 --> 31:20.880
You should say no.

31:20.960 --> 31:22.440
And then I'll say that I was just joking.

31:22.520 --> 31:25.840
So, Elder, where am I cleaning today?

31:52.360 --> 31:54.000
You look a little distressed.

31:54.080 --> 31:57.280
Have you been busy
after becoming the city lord?

32:02.920 --> 32:04.120
Well… That's mine.

32:12.840 --> 32:14.240
Are you so thirsty?

32:14.320 --> 32:18.000
I have cleaned 13 yards
and a toilet today.

32:19.480 --> 32:22.560
Fortunately, the last one is your place.

32:30.520 --> 32:33.000
Why did you clean the toilet
instead of coming here first?

32:34.280 --> 32:37.240
I need to do Elder Cang's bidding,

32:37.320 --> 32:38.960
and I want to spend more time with you.

32:40.240 --> 32:42.360
I thought I was different.

32:43.040 --> 32:44.640
That I might be able to assist you.

32:45.320 --> 32:46.440
It turns out

32:54.800 --> 32:55.960
that I'm just like everyone else.

32:58.640 --> 33:02.880
Are you sure that you see me
like you see everyone else?

33:04.680 --> 33:05.800
Have you washed your hands?

33:07.240 --> 33:08.400
I was tricking you.

33:08.480 --> 33:09.760
I am…

33:13.920 --> 33:15.280
the Saintess of the Dark Abyss.

33:15.800 --> 33:18.560
How could I go clean toilets
if the situation is not critical?

33:22.880 --> 33:25.120
Mr. Nan is staying
in the Bright Snowy Pavilion

33:25.200 --> 33:26.960
and your place
is named Swirling Snow Pavilion.

33:27.040 --> 33:28.240
The two of you are elegant.

33:29.680 --> 33:31.360
Even the tree in the yard…

33:39.800 --> 33:41.960
Why do you have a Xuanling Tree here?

33:42.040 --> 33:44.160
It grows only in the Dark Abyss.

33:44.240 --> 33:45.960
The seed can only be found
in the Dark Abyss.

33:46.040 --> 33:47.360
Have you been there before?

33:47.960 --> 33:48.960
No, of course.

33:49.480 --> 33:51.160
The elders say

33:51.240 --> 33:53.400
that this tree was rooted here
a long time ago.

33:53.480 --> 33:55.680
I don't know how it got here.

33:56.200 --> 33:57.120
So, it's called Xuanling.

34:01.360 --> 34:02.280
The same as your name.

34:05.920 --> 34:08.880
What a pity. The tree
doesn't bloom in the human realm.

34:09.960 --> 34:12.440
I wish you could see its blossoms.
They are beautiful.

34:15.840 --> 34:16.960
It seems that she couldn't

34:17.040 --> 34:19.040
fit in with the life in Snow City
in a short time.

34:20.239 --> 34:21.560
I should have made better arrangements.

34:23.360 --> 34:24.440
I'm thinking

34:25.239 --> 34:27.440
that since this tree can grow up
outside the Dark Abyss,

34:27.960 --> 34:31.120
you will find your place in the Snow City.

34:39.639 --> 34:40.679
Come with me.

34:44.600 --> 34:46.679
First, his home, now his room.

34:47.520 --> 34:48.560
And then…

34:50.080 --> 34:51.920
Xie Xuechen, I'm coming.

35:00.200 --> 35:01.040
You…

35:04.160 --> 35:05.000
You…

35:07.120 --> 35:08.840
Do you like this sword?

35:11.920 --> 35:15.520
If you ask me like that, how can I say no.

35:18.040 --> 35:20.960
I noticed that you had no sword.

35:21.040 --> 35:24.080
To cultivate in Snow City,
a sword is important.

35:24.160 --> 35:27.720
If you don't like this one,
check the others.

35:32.360 --> 35:35.080
These swords are like you. Too tough.

35:35.800 --> 35:38.520
I'm touched, but they are not for me.

35:42.880 --> 35:43.920
Come with me.

35:46.120 --> 35:47.080
Where to?

35:59.800 --> 36:00.920
The Tomb of Swords.

36:02.120 --> 36:03.640
Each sword here

36:04.160 --> 36:06.800
belonged to old timers or disciples
of Snow City.

36:08.480 --> 36:09.880
They were like friends,

36:09.960 --> 36:11.320
following the cultivator
for their whole lives

36:11.840 --> 36:13.520
and left in the Tomb of Swords afterward.

36:14.120 --> 36:15.840
They are like monuments.

36:18.800 --> 36:20.120
Disciples who just joined the Snow City

36:20.200 --> 36:21.880
can pick one here

36:22.680 --> 36:23.840
to be their swords.

36:25.280 --> 36:28.800
So, their former masters have…

36:30.800 --> 36:33.320
People come and go, and humanity lasts.
I understand.

36:36.680 --> 36:38.080
A Snow City disciple must have a sword.

36:38.160 --> 36:39.880
If you don't like the one from before,

36:40.400 --> 36:41.960
get one here.

36:54.560 --> 36:57.160
Have you brought a lot of people here
to pick swords?

37:00.360 --> 37:01.800
You are the first one.

37:08.560 --> 37:12.080
There are a lot of swords.
How should I get the right one?

37:12.600 --> 37:14.640
You can sense the vibes of swords

37:14.720 --> 37:16.880
and pick the one
that resonates with you the most.

37:48.680 --> 37:49.840
Can you hear it?

37:50.360 --> 37:51.600
Heartbeats.

37:53.040 --> 37:54.320
I can always

37:55.600 --> 37:57.040
hear your heartbeats.

37:58.360 --> 38:01.640
But that's your heartbeat.

38:18.120 --> 38:19.400
Xie Xuechen.

38:20.840 --> 38:22.560
I sense that you are seducing me.

38:23.160 --> 38:25.560
-This will delay my cultivation.
-Stop the nonsense.

38:26.560 --> 38:27.400
Go pick a sword.

38:50.640 --> 38:51.760
This one, then.

38:59.720 --> 39:01.280
My first sword.

39:02.480 --> 39:04.080
What should I call it?

39:05.440 --> 39:07.760
How about First Sword?

39:12.640 --> 39:14.960
TEMPLE OF DIVINE EXECUTION

39:17.960 --> 39:20.440
Your Grace, congratulations
on ending your seclusion.

39:21.480 --> 39:23.840
Your Grace, there's a message
from the Decaying Immortal Pavilion.

39:24.440 --> 39:25.360
Xie Daocheng is dead.

39:25.440 --> 39:27.520
Xie Xuechen has become the new lord

39:27.600 --> 39:28.880
and sent a flame message.

39:28.960 --> 39:32.200
The five sects of the Immortal Alliance
will gather at Snow City.

39:35.640 --> 39:37.720
That's a huge move.

39:37.800 --> 39:40.960
It seems that he's trying
to reverse the situation.

39:41.800 --> 39:44.640
How much spiritual power
has Xie Xuechen recovered?

39:48.240 --> 39:50.600
We… We don't know it yet.

39:52.120 --> 39:55.600
Your Grace, why do we have to rely on
the Decaying Immortal Pavilion for this?

39:55.680 --> 39:58.360
Ignorance Demon can easily find that out.

40:00.080 --> 40:02.320
I need him for some other tasks.

40:02.960 --> 40:03.920
Tell the Decaying Immortal Pavilion

40:04.000 --> 40:07.080
to check Xie Xuechen's strength
as soon as possible.

40:07.680 --> 40:08.520
Yes.

40:09.520 --> 40:11.600
Your Grace, when we have the answer,

40:11.680 --> 40:13.520
are you going to bring the war
to the Snow City yourself?

40:13.600 --> 40:14.680
No.

40:15.960 --> 40:18.120
I'm waiting for something.

40:19.520 --> 40:20.560
It won't be long.

40:22.920 --> 40:24.360
Soon.
